8) NOTES / GOTCHAS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Restart tmux senders after editing send_shard.py (running panes keep old code).
- Use ASCII quotes only in commands (" and ') to avoid syntax errors.
- The private 1h cap check example above uses 1000/h (safe target with headroom under 1500/h plan ceiling).
- If you see 450 4.7.1 "Sending limit reached", let the script back off and resume after the wait window.
